@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@operator = trainee-01

### 1. 入库 100 件（默认演示数据：warehouseId=1, locationId=1）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wms/inventory/receive
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: {{operator}}

{
  "idempotencyKey": "receive-demo-001",
  "referenceNo": "ASN-001",
  "skuId": 1001,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "locationId": 1,
  "quantity": 100
}

### 2. T02：创建计划收货 10 件的入库单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wms/inbounds
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: {{operator}}

{
  "orderNo": "IN-T02-001",
  "skuId": 2001,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "locationId": 1,
  "plannedQuantity": 10
}

### 3. T02 起点：尝试首批收货 4 件（把 1 替换为上一步返回的入库单 ID）
# 当前基线预期返回 WMS_INBOUND_FULL_RECEIPT_REQUIRED；这是旧规则，不是程序故障。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wms/inbounds/1/receive
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: {{operator}}

{
  "idempotencyKey": "receive-t02-batch-001",
  "quantity": 4
}

### 4. T02：确认入库单和库存未变化
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wms/inbounds/1
X-Operator: {{operator}}

### 5. 创建出库单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wms/shipments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: {{operator}}

{
  "orderNo": "SO-001",
  "skuId": 1001,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "locationId": 1,
  "quantity": 30
}

### 6. 预占库存（把 1 替换为上一步返回的出库单 ID）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wms/shipments/1/reserve
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: {{operator}}

{
  "idempotencyKey": "reserve-demo-001"
}

### 7. 取消并释放预占库存
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wms/shipments/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: {{operator}}

{
  "idempotencyKey": "cancel-demo-001",
  "reason": "客户取消"
}

### 8. 检查库存
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wms/inventory/balance?skuId=1001&warehouseId=1&locationId=1
X-Operator: {{operator}}

### 9. 库内移库（从库位 1 移到库位 2）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wms/inventory/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: {{operator}}

{
  "idempotencyKey": "transfer-demo-001",
  "transferNo": "TR-001",
  "skuId": 1001,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "sourceLocationId": 1,
  "targetLocationId": 2,
  "quantity": 5
}

### 10. 创建盘点单（只记录快照，不立即调整库存）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wms/stocktakes
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: {{operator}}

{
  "countNo": "COUNT-001",
  "skuId": 1001,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "locationId": 2,
  "countedTotalQuantity": 4
}

### 11. 审批盘点单（把 1 替换为上一步返回的盘点单 ID）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wms/stocktakes/1/approve
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: {{operator}}

{
  "idempotencyKey": "count-approve-demo-001"
}

### 12. 查询盘点结果
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wms/stocktakes/1
X-Operator: {{operator}}
